# Ruling 2024-09-20: "You'll still manifest dread even if this Equipment isn't on the battlefield when its first ability resolves." Bot2 destroys
# the Windbreaker with Disenchant in response to its enters trigger: Bot1 still manifests dread (the Elves goes face down, the Bolt to the graveyard),
# and the attach does nothing (CR 701.3b): the face-down 2/2 has no flying.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Cursed Windbreaker
Plains x6
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Disenchant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Cursed Windbreaker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Cursed Windbreaker)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Llanowar Elves | Lightning Bolt)
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Cursed Windbreaker; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield..Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield..Keywords = (absent)
